		"name": "ApnaPay - SIP APIs",
		"description": "Comprehensive Postman Collection for ApnaPay Systematic Investment Plan (SIP) Module.\n\n### Base URL:\n`http://localhost:5000`\n\n### Modules Included:\n1. **SIP Products**: Browse mutual funds/SIP products and view details\n2. **SIP Plans**: Create SIP plans, list user SIPs, view full breakdown\n3. **Installments**: View upcoming installment schedules\n4. **Plan Lifecycle**: Pause, Resume, and Cancel SIP\n5. **Mandates**: Create auto-pay mandates (eNACH, UPI AutoPay) and view mandates\n6. **Transactions**: View SIP debit and investment transaction history\n\n*Equipped with automated test scripts to dynamically capture `productId`, `sipPlanId`, `mandateReference`, and `cancellationReference`.*",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
